{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/e542d55e05d06e63bbf3dadd467d6f4889a15a6c2c43b46c812a48b6ee2adf7ff126e17cb0d3c04d4d2f24d216f00138ed4cd9cbf209538cb1bd0f4fd7ac7f15","height":2000,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ECgal03qq-GPHfoWRZft82d97qPwwB-M4z1d-igDCWWAMWhJteOVP4HzaU2XhhQVfG9ME-_0DWTFA1eK28kgnTgTHBpSnTIhLK8TQKwE0zyq_lFckrs","width":2000},"name":"James Williams","title":"Material Developer Advocate"},"document_id":5856972825690112,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":["```java\nval snapHelper = CarouselSnapHelper()\nsnapHelper.attachToRecyclerView(carouselRecyclerView)\n```","```java\n<!-- Primary colors -->\n  <color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_dark_primary\">@color/m3_ref_palette_dynamic_primary80</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_dark_on_primary\">@color/m3_ref_palette_dynamic_primary20</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_dark_primary_container\">@color/m3_ref_palette_dynamic_primary30</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_dark_on_primary_container\">@color/m3_ref_palette_dynamic_primary90</color>\n\n<!-- Baseline palette – Primary -->\n  <color name=\"m3_ref_palette_dynamic_primary100\">@android:color/system_accent1_0</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_ref_palette_dynamic_primary99\">@android:color/system_accent1_10</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_ref_palette_dynamic_primary95\">@android:color/system_accent1_50</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_ref_palette_dynamic_primary90\">@android:color/system_accent1_100</color>\n```","```java\n<color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_light_primary\">@android:color/system_primary_light</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_light_on_primary\">@android:color/system_on_primary_light</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_light_primary_container\">@android:color/system_primary_container_light</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_light_on_primary_container\">@android:color/system_on_primary_container_light</color>\n\n<color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_dark_primary\">@android:color/system_primary_dark</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_dark_on_primary\">@android:color/system_on_primary_dark</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_dark_primary_container\">@android:color/system_primary_container_dark</color>\n  <color name=\"m3_sys_color_dynamic_dark_on_primary_container\">@android:color/system_on_primary_container_dark</color>\n```"],"content":"<p>Material Design Components 1.11 和 1.12 版本在我们一年一度的开发者大会 Google I/O 前夕发布，为 Carousel 控件带来了多项新选项、对颜色主题化的扩展，以及针对进度指示器和滑块的非文本对比度更新。在 1.12 版本中，MDC Views 的最低 SDK 版本提升至 API 19，与 AndroidX 的其他部分保持一致。1.12 还将其对 androidx.transition 的依赖（用于 SharedElement 过渡动画、Fade 和<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/guide/navigation/custom-back/support-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">预测性返回动画</a>）从 1.2.0 更新至 1.5.0。</p>\n<h2>轮播更新</h2>\n<p>在<a href=\"https://material.io/blog/android-stable-release-1-10-0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">上一篇文章</a>中，我们宣布了新的 Carousel 策略 HeroCarouselStrategy，可用于展示大型、更具沉浸感的内容。在 MDC 1.11 中，我们新增了两个策略 - UncontainedCarouselStrategy 和 FullscreenCarouselStrategy。此外，我们还新增了将任意轮播居中对齐的选项，让大型焦点条目可以置于滚动容器的中心。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-col-set cols=2&gt;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;&lt;mio-image index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;&lt;mio-image index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-col-set&gt;</p>\n<p><code>UncontainedCarouselStrategy</code> 不会改变轮播条目的宽高比。当改变条目的大小可能有损其含义时，这种策略很有用 - 例如，专辑封面轮播可能适合保留可辨识的 1:1 宽高比。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p><code>FullScreenCarouselStrategy</code> 允许单个条目占据容器中的全部可用空间。这适用于视频或幻灯片等完全沉浸式内容，其中的条目一次只与一个交互或查看。我们只建议在竖直方向上使用该策略。</p>\n<p><strong>条目吸附</strong></p>\n<p><code>CarouselSnapHelper</code> 让你的轮播能够将焦点交给最近的条目。它可以用于所有策略，但强烈建议在 hero 轮播和全屏轮播上使用。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<h2>颜色变化</h2>\n<p>API 34 提供<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/master/docs/theming/Color.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">扩展的颜色集合</a>，为你提供更多个性化应用的方式。其中一些新增内容（例如新的 surface 选项）已被融入组件。而 Fixed 和 Dim 颜色则是面向开发者的选项，截至撰写本文时组件库尚未使用它们。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=3&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>系统 UI 访问命名的颜色角色</strong></p>\n<p>在 API 34 之前，使用动态颜色（dynamic color）时，颜色以调色板中单个色调的形式存储。MDC 会将这些颜色映射到<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/master/lib/java/com/google/android/material/color/res/values-v31/tokens.xml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">动态颜色属性，然后将这些属性分配给颜色角色</a>。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=1&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<p>从 API 34 开始，这条路径更加直接和紧凑。Material 颜色角色直接映射到来自<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/master/lib/java/com/google/android/material/color/res/values-v34/tokens.xml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><code>@android:color</code> 命名空间</a>的颜色资源。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-code-snippet index=2&gt;&lt;/mio-code-snippet&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>Fixed 和 Fixed Dim</strong></p>\n<p>Fixed 和 Fixed Dim 颜色角色是颜色规范的新增内容。Fixed 颜色角色在浅色主题和深色主题之间保持不变。Dim 颜色角色为相应的颜色角色提供了强调程度更低的选项。这两类颜色角色均未在组件中使用，但可用于进一步自定义你的 UI。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=4&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>表面（Surface）</strong></p>\n<p>此前在 Material 主题中，我们只提供了一个 surface 颜色值，并在运行时通过与主色混合（基于海拔高度）来计算其插值变体。这在实现 UI 时令开发者和设计师颇为头疼，因为他们无法直接指定这些颜色。</p>\n<p>主题化功能新增了模拟不同海拔高度的颜色角色。现在共有三种 surface 颜色选项和五种 surface 容器选项。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=5&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p>Surface（表面） Bright（亮表面） 保证是最浅的 surface 颜色。</p>\n<p>Surface 与之前的版本基本保持一致。</p>\n<p>Surface Dim（暗表面） 与其对应的 Surface 颜色角色相同或更深。</p>\n<p>Surface Container（表面容器） Lowest（最低表面容器）、Low、High 和 Highest 是额外的颜色角色，与 Surface Container 相比可以提供更强或更弱的强调。</p>\n<p>以下组件使用了部分新的 surface 容器颜色角色：</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-col-set cols=2&gt;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/buttons/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">凸起按钮（Elevated Button）</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/bottom-app-bar/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">底部应用栏</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/navigation-bar/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">底部导航栏</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/bottom-sheets/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">底部面板（Bottom Sheet）</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/side-sheets/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">模态侧边面板（Modal Side Sheet）</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/cards/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">凸起卡片（Elevated Card）</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/chips/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">凸起信息条（Elevated Chips）</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/date-pickers/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">日期选择器（Datepicker）</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/dialogs/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">对话框</span></a></p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/floating-action-button/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Surface FAB</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">/ </span><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/extended-fab/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Surface 扩展 FAB</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/menus/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">菜单</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/navigation-drawer/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">导航抽屉</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/search/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">搜索</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/switch/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">开关</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/text-fields/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">文本框</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/time-pickers/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">时间选择器（Timepicker）</span></a></p>\n<p><a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://m3.material.io/components/top-app-bar/specs\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; -webkit-text-decoration-skip: none; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">顶部应用栏</span></a></p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-col-set&gt;</p>\n<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-47e41fb8-7fff-e4ee-4a40-9b3121029bc4\"></span></p>\n<p>新的颜色角色现已在 <a href=\"https://material-foundation.github.io/material-theme-builder/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Material Theme Builder</a> 中可用。</p>\n<p><strong>进度指示器和滑块的非文本对比度（NTC）更新</strong></p>\n<p>非文本对比度标准首先要求评估控件中哪些部分对于标示其状态、交互选项和可读性至关重要，其次要求做出更改来改进这些关键属性，并确保这些部分达到最低对比度（截至撰写本文时，标准对比度下为 3:1）。进度指示器和滑块已更新以落实这些标准。</p>\n<p><strong>进度指示器&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>针对进度指示器的 NTC 改动包括：为线性进度指示器的活动轨道与非活动轨道之间提供清晰可辨的间隙。对于圆形进度指示器，1.12 之前的版本默认不包含轨道，导致其数值更难估算。现在会绘制一条非活动轨道来补全整个圆，并在轨道与活动指示器相接处的两端留出间隙。</p>\n<p>其中许多选项（例如间隙大小和轨道属性）都可以在 XML 代码中设置。完整列表可在<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/master/docs/components/ProgressIndicator.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">此处</a>查看。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-col-set cols=3&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;&lt;mio-image index=6&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;&lt;mio-image index=7&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;&lt;mio-image index=8&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-col-set&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-image index=9&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;</p>\n<p><strong>滑块</strong></p>\n<p>滑块经历了与进度指示器类似的改动。活动轨道与非活动轨道之间现在有了间隙。滑块的默认拇指（thumb）也从相连的实心圆形改为竖直条形，两侧间隙可配置。带格式的数值标签形状也经过了一些微调，以满足 NTC 要求。</p>\n<p>与进度指示器一样，你可以在 XML 代码中配置这些属性。完整列表可在<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/blob/master/docs/components/Slider.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">此处</a>查看。</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-col-set cols=3&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;&lt;mio-image index=10&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;&lt;mio-image index=11&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;mio-column&gt;&lt;mio-image index=12&gt;&lt;/mio-image&gt;&lt;/mio-column&gt;</p>\n<p>&lt;/mio-col-set&gt;</p>\n<h2>MDC 的下一步？</h2>\n<p>我们正全力开发 1.13.0 版本。我们在这些文章中着重介绍的组件或特性只是每个版本所包含工作的一部分。完整列表请查看<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/tag/1.12.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">发布说明</a>。</p>\n<p>你可以在 GitHub 上关注新版本的进展、提交<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=bug&amp;template=bug_report.md&amp;title=%5BComponent+name%5D+Short+description+of+issue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">bug 报告</a>和<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/issues/new?assignees=&amp;labels=feature+request&amp;template=feature_request.md&amp;title=%5BComponent+name%5D+Short+description+of+request\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">功能请求</a>。查看<a href=\"https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/download/1.12.0/catalog-debug.apk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">目录应用</a>来了解组件的实际效果。也欢迎在 Twitter 上联系我们 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/materialdesign\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">@materialdesign</a>。</p>","image":[{"a11y_description":"carousel component","bordered":true,"caption":"Start-aligned HeroCarouselStrategy","case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/b129c94f47a1e2dab612df05b619c5c8b15ef9e9c0fecb6956435596128dfb5790d144dd6119684115efbc4ef1394bd7702bdc2667c9940a1eb9240d6be0e546","height":568,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4dfYjomm9jLyZrmrpQj6wbwMw5Zryb1iKscfrxOsijGLEkGJdIOqw2b_xFp-s9E3iwuwl9RY2CYQQSkwSgDb3eETUysLyFtEi6YYjCc4TIaLlaCPppY","width":1080}},{"a11y_description":"Carousel component","bordered":true,"caption":"Center-aligned HeroCarouselStrategy","case":null,"file